    (by [url=https://twitter.com/LapperDev]LapperDev[/url])
Sonic belongs to SEGA
   (and also a lot of the sprites and sounds)
Made with [url=https://godotengine.org]Godot[/url]
Special thanks to the [url=https://info.sonicretro.org/Sonic_Physics_Guide]Sonic Physics Guide[/url]
Ripped sprites taken from The Spriters Resource
Music mostly taken from Zophar's Domain

Fonts used:
[url=https://www.spriters-resource.com/sega_genesis_32x/sonicth3/sheet/85193/][font_size=14][font=res://sprites/fonts/ui_font.png]Font from Sonic 3, sourced from TSR, extended by CST1229[/font][/font_size][/url]
[url=https://managore.itch.io/m6x11][font_size=18][font=res://sprites/fonts/m6x11plus.ttf]m6x11 by Daniel Linssen[/font][/font_size][/url]
[url=https://nimblebeastscollective.itch.io/nb-pixel-font-bundle][font_size=16][font=res://sprites/fonts/Habbo.ttf]Habbo by Omni[/font][/font_size][/url]
[font_size=5][font=res://sprites/fonts/tiny_font.png]Custom tiny font made by CST1229[/font][/font_size]

Songs used:
[music_credits]

